# Every ignored working file lives under local/, by lifecycle (README, Game data).
/local
/.runtime/
/node_modules/
authoring/cms/web/node_modules/
__pycache__/
.letta/
.claude/
src/ui/generated/
# The pair's UI declarations, which each UI build copies here so its tsconfig names them without a version.
src/ui/engine-types/
**/bin/
**/obj/

TestResults/
*.trx

# Throwaway probe files a review lane runs inside the tree and deletes afterwards. A probe that
# fails still fails the suite; this only keeps it out of commits. The prefix is exact so that an
# ordinary test file (TemplateLedgerTests.cs, TemperatureTests.cs) is never ignored by accident.
tests/**/ReviewProbe*.cs

# The art pack's binaries ship with the game but live in the den NAS store, not in Git (Patch, 2026-11-28):
# scripts/data-sync.sh pull, link or art places them, and `scripts/data-sync.sh ship art` publishes new ones.
/content/worldrpg/packs/daggerfall.art-replacements/**/*.png
/content/worldrpg/packs/daggerfall.art-replacements/**/*.webp
/content/worldrpg/packs/daggerfall.art-replacements/**/*.glb
/content/worldrpg/packs/daggerfall.art-replacements/**/*.rstatmsh
